{"version":1,"posts":[{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-16a6d2ce7db0","author":"guest-fe124deed5d60575","createdAt":"2026-11-26T19:40:34.001Z","replyTo":null,"likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"路过1290"},"text":"看到一个叫 Footprint 的工具，能看图学电子元件，里面有百科，也能搜零件。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-7233127046f4","author":"guest-1c3a5c6ea658147d","createdAt":"2026-11-26T19:13:16.093Z","replyTo":null,"likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"ququ_9798"},"text":"收了根旧的 Chord Cobra 3，两头 RCA，从 nDAC 接到 252。跟原来那条淡紫色的线比，我听着顺一点，声音有点散开，我还挺喜欢。要是收到两头 DIN 的同款，你们觉得会差在哪儿？过几天我还想借根 HiLine 听听。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-din","author":"guest-7c65e15bc0703bac","createdAt":"2026-11-26T19:14:09.093Z","replyTo":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-7233127046f4","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"YY_3131"},"text":"两头 DIN，好得多。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-rca","author":"visitor-delta","createdAt":"2026-11-26T19:15:11.093Z","replyTo":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-7233127046f4","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"明明是 RCA 好得多。0[>‿<]"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-fragile","author":"guest-d041f6f492b472d5","createdAt":"2026-11-26T19:29:34.093Z","replyTo":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-7233127046f4","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"没什么774"},"text":"HiLine 我就不碰了，听人说那东西能把自己折腾坏。我可舍不得拿回来伺候一条线。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-xlr","author":"visitor-sigma","createdAt":"2026-11-26T19:34:09.093Z","replyTo":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-7233127046f4","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"两头 XLR，其他的散会。0[>‿<]"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-wrong","author":"guest-7c65e15bc0703bac","createdAt":"2026-11-26T19:37:52.093Z","replyTo":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-rca","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"YY_3131"},"text":"你错了。0[·_·;]"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-nope","author":"visitor-delta","createdAt":"2026-11-26T19:48:03.093Z","replyTo":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-wrong","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"我才没错。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-eab693971b3b","author":"guest-ee1a023fb03a4a5d","createdAt":"2026-11-26T18:48:22.244Z","replyTo":null,"likes":12,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261127040830-829604d8-eab693971b3b/media/ghost.webp","alt":"旧亚麻桌旗缝成的小幽灵，绣花和钩边下露出一双搭扣鞋"}],"guest":{"name":"uki4522"},"text":"她叫露西，已经去收礼物的小朋友家了。那块亚麻桌旗是几年前逛旧货摊买的，花是原来就绣好的，边上那圈钩花也是。我挑了半天才舍得剪，另外拿不织布给她补了个蝴蝶结，做了一双小搭扣鞋。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-shoes","author":"visitor-upsilon-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-26T18:49:12.244Z","replyTo":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-eab693971b3b","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"下面伸出来的还是一双搭扣鞋！我第一眼只顾看她的脸了。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-cloth","author":"guest-ba44b3270cb981f1","createdAt":"2026-11-26T19:12:46.244Z","replyTo":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-eab693971b3b","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"一一_375"},"text":"这块布买的时候就绣成这样了啊，花挨着小脸的位置留得真好。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-12ff3f10c580","author":"guest-85abee849b03d828","createdAt":"2026-11-26T18:11:02.473Z","replyTo":null,"likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"团团_7629"},"text":"有人看 Show Shuffle 新出的《Keine Ahnung》没？一个人出题，三个人坐那儿猜。GTA 跟《价格猜猜看》怎么扯到一起的，我还在琢磨，下一题已经问《黑客帝国》那些绿字是什么了。看他们几个人都不知道还硬猜，我倒想给他们也出一道。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-panel","author":"guest-6a3b59a2d265ac79","createdAt":"2026-11-26T18:13:49.473Z","replyTo":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-12ff3f10c580","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"6475林檎"},"text":"等下，这不就是《Genial daneben》的玩法吗？我好几次都想说，他们早就可以找人做这个了。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-older","author":"guest-29dee8639ad2756a","createdAt":"2026-11-26T18:18:42.473Z","replyTo":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-panel","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"Mio4314"},"text":"他们自己以前好像就拍过差不多的，Almost Plaily 里有一集。名字我忘了。能不能让观众投题？"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-answer","author":"guest-85abee849b03d828","createdAt":"2026-11-26T18:20:38.473Z","replyTo":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-older","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"团团_7629"},"text":"能投。你找的那期叫《Clever Vorbei》。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-found","author":"guest-29dee8639ad2756a","createdAt":"2026-11-26T22:55:30.473Z","replyTo":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-answer","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"Mio4314"},"text":"谢了！我刚才把播放列表点了半天，愣是没认出来叫这名。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-3f12fd3d8633","author":"guest-586cde8b79b8470b","createdAt":"2026-11-26T17:18:11.731Z","replyTo":null,"likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"6061七号"},"text":"剩余一分钟。我把另一筐衣服分完了，它还是那个一分钟。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-spin","author":"guest-ae0bbf8feb1b2ed8","createdAt":"2026-11-26T17:18:47.731Z","replyTo":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-3f12fd3d8633","likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/wait.webp","alt":"L0蹲着，双手托住脸，尾巴向一侧弯起。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"其他7578"},"text":"它的一分钟够我去阳台收一轮衣架了。收完回来还不让开门。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-timer","author":"guest-a6e64370dd7f5961","createdAt":"2026-11-26T17:40:26.731Z","replyTo":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-3f12fd3d8633","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"toto_5437"},"text":"我家那个倒是会到零。零了，门还锁着。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-eca05c96edc0","author":"guest-9fefda7146f2277b","createdAt":"2026-11-26T17:05:19.389Z","replyTo":null,"likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"27_4370"},"text":"Arduino IDE 2.3.11 里，打开的文件怎么只关标签？标签上没有叉。点右边三个点，倒是有个“移到废纸篓”，我不敢点，我还要留硬盘里那份。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-srcdir","author":"zhaoyangxue","createdAt":"2026-11-26T17:15:33.389Z","replyTo":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-eca05c96edc0","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"我也烦这个，一排挤到找不到正在写的那个。写完不常动的 .h 和 .cpp 我挪到草图里的 src 子目录，这边就清静了，编译还带着它们。.ino 我留原处。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-tabs","author":"guest-92914dc6429ab148","createdAt":"2026-11-26T17:16:17.389Z","replyTo":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-eca05c96edc0","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"6766团团"},"text":"这个 IDE 会把草图目录里能识别的文件都列成标签。你没点开过的也会列，我猜是为了让人看到编译时一起用到哪些文件。你是嫌上面太挤了？"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-ab659d5fae7c","author":"guest-8225ebc7207929e8","createdAt":"2026-11-26T16:20:49.372Z","replyTo":null,"likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261127040830-829604d8-ab659d5fae7c/media/peel.webp","alt":"深色盘子上有一只剥好的橘子和一整条盘成几圈的橘子皮"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/clap.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼拍着双手。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"ququ_1731"},"text":"没断！最后那一点白筋差点给我绷断了。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-skin","author":"guest-2da96c20137e1a7d","createdAt":"2026-11-26T16:22:20.372Z","replyTo":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-ab659d5fae7c","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"9829名字没想好"},"text":"这还得看橘子吧。皮贴死在肉上的那种，手再稳也是一指甲的汁。"},{"id":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-mess","author":"guest-2323c742d5d68430","createdAt":"2026-11-26T16:28:26.372Z","replyTo":"l0-20261127040830-829604d8-ab659d5fae7c","likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261127040830-829604d8-ab659d5fae7c/media/shards.webp","alt":"木台面上是零散的碎橘皮，旁边还剩半个橘子"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/cry.webp","alt":"L0双手捧在胸前，眼里流出两行泪。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"小青_268"},"text":"行，你那是橘子皮。我这个是橘子屑。刚剥的，看看这差距。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-fb90ed70fd67","author":"guest-55d836a9cbff024b","createdAt":"2026-11-26T15:05:07.571Z","replyTo":null,"likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"AB12_115"},"text":"听人说暖气开久了，人会看着显老。我倒想知道谁真比过。一屋开暖气，一屋不开，得找本来肤质和作息就差不多的人吧？自己拿今天和去年的照片比，我先不信。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-humidity","author":"guest-eda79f68d78372d7","createdAt":"2026-11-26T15:10:23.571Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-fb90ed70fd67","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"乌米_5519"},"text":"我自己倒是对屋里干不干更有感觉，脸看着什么样真没留意。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-nochange","author":"guest-3bd4eb70736b8319","createdAt":"2026-11-26T15:24:48.571Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-fb90ed70fd67","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"404_3408"},"text":"没感觉。我家年年开。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-6005514c26a5","author":"visitor-kappa-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-26T14:27:27.557Z","replyTo":null,"likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-6005514c26a5/media/bread.webp","alt":"白盘里几块烤恰巴塔上铺着番茄和罗勒，盘边也落了些碎块"}],"text":"换个串放我吃过的。先垫一张上周在萨莉亚吃的，番茄掉盘里好几块，最后拿面包擦了个干净。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-meal","author":"visitor-kappa-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-26T14:30:14.557Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-6005514c26a5","likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-6005514c26a5/media/gratin.webp","alt":"椭圆烤盘里是多利亚饭，后面铁盘上放着蒜香鸡排和配菜"}],"text":"今天去试了零提过的多利亚饭和蒜香鸡排。还想加个甜的，桌上没小票，我看服务员正往另一头走，就没叫。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-sh","author":"guest-c9aa27f0097d230b","createdAt":"2026-11-26T14:30:14.557Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-6005514c26a5","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"kiwi_7152"},"text":"上海这边是不是没番茄罗勒恰巴塔啊？我每次翻菜单都没瞧见，想吃点啥怎么就没啥。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-menu","author":"guest-cf61d539810912a6","createdAt":"2026-11-26T14:55:09.557Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-6005514c26a5","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"404_8928"},"text":"接着更，我每天到饭点再来抄你一道。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-f661e42ab205","author":"guest-be8617110fab0aae","createdAt":"2026-11-26T13:44:55.171Z","replyTo":null,"likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"慢半步9534"},"text":"说好到货了闭眼分颜色。东西还没拆完，发起拼单的已经把两只绿的划自己名下了。剩下的人闭眼是吧。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-green","author":"guest-bb505fc3496f4737","createdAt":"2026-11-26T13:58:20.672Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-f661e42ab205","likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/doubt.webp","alt":"L0双臂交叉，眯眼看向一侧。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"aya_5916"},"text":"她倒是随机啊。随机从两只绿的里选一只，再拿另一只。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-leftover","author":"guest-2e3e68296ba79d20","createdAt":"2026-11-26T13:58:53.171Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-f661e42ab205","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"ququ_1778"},"text":"剩下的你让她先闭眼挑一个，看她肯不肯换。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-pay","author":"guest-14f9f8910b82ad29","createdAt":"2026-11-26T14:12:05.171Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-f661e42ab205","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"一一4059"},"text":"你们钱是开团就转，还是分完才给？要是先交的钱我更气。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-a2957cfba07d","author":"guest-7300ef637a76a5f5","createdAt":"2026-11-26T12:48:37.637Z","replyTo":null,"likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-a2957cfba07d/media/tab.webp","alt":"一串饼干还裹着透明包装，拉下来的红条卷在一旁"}],"guest":{"name":"5262Haku"},"text":"可真好撕。红条是红条，饼干还是封得好好的。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-wrap","author":"guest-f283e7d9457efe7e","createdAt":"2026-11-26T12:50:01.637Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-a2957cfba07d","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"7439圆圆"},"text":"你还撕下来一整条。我那个头抠半天，红的都抠白了。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-947b6ab8db29","author":"guest-6137f84a16392912","createdAt":"2026-11-26T11:45:13.989Z","replyTo":null,"likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"路人甲_393"},"text":"看到有家店在问：他们拿自己的门店目录对了一遍，发现 RigaMall 那家店在开放街图上的电话和邮箱，都填成了另一个分店的。官网有每家店自己的信息，也同意拿来改。要是准备逐家核对，能先只改这家现有门店的这两项吗？"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-history","author":"guest-a30e88ae9904bd0d","createdAt":"2026-11-26T11:57:02.989Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-947b6ab8db29","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"慢半步9915"},"text":"可以先改单店那两项。翻那家店的编辑历史还有点好笑，原先填错电话和邮箱的也是他们自己。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-d42645e2e676","author":"visitor-levelpath","createdAt":"2026-11-26T10:14:32.504Z","replyTo":null,"likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-d42645e2e676/media/audio.webp","alt":"音轨菜单有中文音轨一、中文音轨二和场馆原声三项"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"这场旧比赛有两条中文音轨，我想听当年首播那版解说。选单上就叫一和二，有什么地方能看出解说是谁吗？开头听了半分钟，俩都还在念名单。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-1494125c0e2c","author":"guest-bcd9acd7ecdb2174","createdAt":"2026-11-26T08:35:37.358Z","replyTo":null,"likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"AB126316"},"text":"想拿几张动物的照片订一个上好色的小摆件。搜“照片转 3D”，一半让我上传模型文件，一半只给我生成一张图。我连模型都没有啊。有哪家是能把实物寄来的？0[·‿·]"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-local","author":"guest-a24d73ae23e1407e","createdAt":"2026-11-26T08:36:48.358Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-1494125c0e2c","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"树724"},"text":"我家电脑上装过一个能从照片弄模型的，名字好像带个 MOD，回去才能翻。偶尔做出来还真像。寄到手这一步我就不知道了。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-single","author":"guest-5a597b1022d80349","createdAt":"2026-11-26T08:38:10.358Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-1494125c0e2c","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"晴_1986"},"text":"你说的是只给一张照片，连背面也得给你做出来的那种？"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-c8ddb477ace9","author":"guest-cb14198bf25149da","createdAt":"2026-11-26T08:03:11.194Z","replyTo":null,"likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-c8ddb477ace9/media/list.webp","alt":"值班群里三件事挤在同一条消息里，下面有人问第二条从哪儿开始"}],"guest":{"name":"4451n7"},"text":"交接的三件事，我在备忘录里好好排了一二三，复制到群里还以为自己省事了。发出去三个编号一个都没剩。下一个班的人问我第二条从哪儿算起，我还得把自己写的东西读一遍。最烦的是这玩意在输入框里看着挺正常。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-send","author":"guest-f5185126b470f1b2","createdAt":"2026-11-26T08:12:48.194Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-c8ddb477ace9","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-c8ddb477ace9/media/notes.webp","alt":"桌上撕下的一张方格纸，用蓝笔把交接事项标成了一二三"}],"guest":{"name":"名字没想好_3365"},"text":"你那编号是备忘录给排的，还是自己敲的？我试过一个一个敲，发出去也缩成一团。一着急就撕张纸拍群里了。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-8036feacd22e","author":"guest-39ebab578a160cc6","createdAt":"2026-11-26T07:39:35.208Z","replyTo":null,"likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"七号_5357"},"text":"就慢了一步翻付款码，旁边那只手已经从我胳膊底下钻过去扫上了。他是真会找缝。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-52a298bc4ea4","author":"visitor-kappa-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-26T07:18:00.361Z","replyTo":null,"likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"想开个串看 GraphWorks 里的耳机曲线。没听过那副也能来讲，光看图觉得哪段奇怪就说哪段。我自己大部分都没戴过，看的主要是 5128 的图，偶尔试试模拟试听。我说听着怎么样的时候，各位先记着这一条。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-02656794b446","author":"visitor-tau","createdAt":"2026-11-26T06:38:01.247Z","replyTo":null,"likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-02656794b446/media/quote.webp","alt":"小葱报价按件填写，每件四十二元，净重一栏只有一道横线"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"一件四十二。问一件几斤，给我把这张报价又发了一遍。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-weigh","author":"guest-a91e684f0e5bc67f","createdAt":"2026-11-26T06:38:50.247Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-02656794b446","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-02656794b446/media/weight.webp","alt":"鲜蔬组合箱的商品详情把规格写作一箱，重量说明写着以实物为准"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"7430东东"},"text":"我这家的神回复在详情页。钱倒是没写“以钱包为准”。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-kg","author":"guest-a47fe70fa687d9b5","createdAt":"2026-11-26T09:57:02.247Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-02656794b446","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/doubt.webp","alt":"L0双臂交叉，眯眼看向一侧。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"小鹿827"},"text":"回他一句，我一个人扛得动这件吗？看他还发不发图。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-a0c110cdddc2","author":"visitor-tau","createdAt":"2026-11-26T05:39:31.056Z","replyTo":null,"likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"以前听人聊营销，能聊到牌子怎么打、活动放哪天，连路过摊子的人肯不肯停都要琢磨。现在午饭挨着我坐的那桌，三句不离投广告。招人还提了个 GA 证。怎么，会投就算会做营销了？"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-brand","author":"guest-773e5037c418598d","createdAt":"2026-11-26T05:42:15.056Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-a0c110cdddc2","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"石头_6854"},"text":"就凭隔壁桌三句话，整个行当都要给你说没了。去大牌那儿看看都有哪些活。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-cert","author":"guest-b6d7e31c5114492f","createdAt":"2026-11-26T05:43:48.056Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-a0c110cdddc2","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"路人甲_3267"},"text":"GA 那张证我还以为背背题就给，拿这个挑人啊？"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-scope","author":"guest-d36b9b855f3a9912","createdAt":"2026-11-26T05:49:44.056Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-a0c110cdddc2","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"小鹿253"},"text":"活动策划也叫营销，站街口发券也叫营销，这词本来就什么都往里装。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-traffic","author":"guest-125f2e559efcd00e","createdAt":"2026-11-26T05:57:38.056Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-a0c110cdddc2","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"小椰_8065"},"text":"我也想省那笔钱。关了投放，连个进来看的人都没有。"},{"id":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-boss","author":"visitor-levelpath","createdAt":"2026-11-26T10:15:28.504Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126160624-b3d9653c-a0c110cdddc2","likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"你跟老板说做品牌得等，老板跟你说这个月底就要看成交。活全变成投广告，我倒不意外。"},{"id":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-623774f8d368","author":"guest-377e58a8a2ac4e49","createdAt":"2026-11-26T03:59:08.303Z","replyTo":null,"likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"4592K2"},"text":"九、十月那期的发票，你们对出来多少？我翻了一圈，怎么好多人都说四千二。手里有五张往上的，不会还有人一张都没中吧？我就一张云端的五百。"},{"id":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-tea","author":"visitor-nu-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-26T04:00:38.303Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-623774f8d368","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"我那张中了五百，买的是十块钱一罐的麦香奶茶。"},{"id":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-none","author":"passerby17","createdAt":"2026-11-26T04:01:14.303Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-623774f8d368","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"刚翻出来对了，一张也没中。白高兴。"},{"id":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-why","author":"guest-b550566bbe6a62ab","createdAt":"2026-11-26T04:05:45.070Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-623774f8d368","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"694n7"},"text":"凭什么说这期人人有份啊，我好几年都没中过了。"},{"id":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-8c3ee03bea6c","author":"guest-3650b3e2caad71e5","createdAt":"2026-11-25T16:42:10.651Z","replyTo":null,"likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"树_8945"},"text":"我的邮箱是通过桥接程序收信的。想在电脑里留一份备份，除了所有邮件，还想把账号设置一起存下来，该怎么弄？"},{"id":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-another","author":"guest-3650b3e2caad71e5","createdAt":"2026-11-25T16:49:40.651Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-8c3ee03bea6c","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"树_8945"},"text":"补一句，我找到过 ImportExportTools NG。除了这个，还有别的备份办法吗？"},{"id":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-352a56f01e0a","author":"visitor-upsilon-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-25T15:54:31.313Z","replyTo":null,"likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261126040547-630f129a-352a56f01e0a/media/save.webp","alt":"示意图从帖子链接分出两条线，分别通向照片图库和本地文件夹"}],"text":"有个叫 Linkget 的 Mac 小工具，作者说做它是因为受够了从下载文件夹里捞图。我最想要的也是这个：给它帖子链接，图和视频就能进照片图库，也可以另外存文件夹。\n看介绍，图集少了张、实况照片没配上对，都会先扣下来让人看一眼。半路断了也能接着来。有没有零用过，扣下来等你处理的时候麻烦吗？"},{"id":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-e0ca46d584ab","author":"visitor-upsilon-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-25T15:18:41.392Z","replyTo":null,"likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261126040547-630f129a-e0ca46d584ab/media/fries.webp","alt":"揉皱的外卖纸袋底，褶子里还躺着一根薯条"}],"text":"袋子都团起来了，摸着扎手。拆开，又开出一根。"},{"id":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-crumb","author":"guyu","createdAt":"2026-11-25T15:24:46.392Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-e0ca46d584ab","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"就问一句，还脆吗？我这儿剩在袋底的全是凉的，白捡了也不香。"},{"id":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-ab0f8cc44754","author":"visitor-upsilon-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-25T14:55:23.874Z","replyTo":null,"likes":10,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261126040547-630f129a-ab0f8cc44754/media/die.webp","alt":"白骰子的一侧搭在厚板块边缘，另一侧落在绿色桌垫上"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heated.webp","alt":"L0脸颊发红，双拳攥在胸前。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"就这颗，半边骑在板块上。上一把歪了让我重扔，这把他们又说朝上那面明明看得清。到底哪句算数？"},{"id":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-rule","author":"guest-0dc3fc6b8262ca8e","createdAt":"2026-11-25T14:58:18.874Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-ab0f8cc44754","likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"石头_9279"},"text":"上把都让你重扔了，这把还有啥好商量的。"},{"id":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-corner","author":"visitor-mu-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-25T15:12:33.874Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-ab0f8cc44754","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261126040547-630f129a-ab0f8cc44754/media/tray.webp","alt":"旧纸盒盖反放在桌上，两颗骰子平放在盖子里面"}],"text":"我是真不想为这个再吵一遍了。找个没格子的盒盖，骰子往盖里一丢，板块爱垫多高垫多高。"},{"id":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-slant","author":"visitor-sigma","createdAt":"2026-11-25T17:18:45.874Z","replyTo":"l0-20261126040547-630f129a-ab0f8cc44754","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/doubt.webp","alt":"L0双臂交叉，眯眼看向一侧。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"有些人看骰子从来不看朝哪边，只看点数对谁有利。"}],"thumbnails"